WEBVTT

00:04.660 --> 00:06.080
A fire...

00:06.160 --> 00:07.460
Dragon?!

00:08.120 --> 00:10.380
Orc-face, you didn't...!

00:10.460 --> 00:11.540
I did.

00:11.630 --> 00:15.510
Forget fighting some freaky thing with no physical body.

00:15.590 --> 00:17.760
The Blaze Dragon.

00:17.840 --> 00:22.800
I'll let that dragon consume the thing's healing energy, its "Divine Might".

00:22.890 --> 00:24.180
And then I'll slay it!

00:24.260 --> 00:25.520
Umm...

00:25.600 --> 00:28.850
Alicia!? And Raiga and Edgar!

00:28.940 --> 00:32.730
The Blaze Dragon just revived using high-density holy magic.

00:33.360 --> 00:37.360
It already had insta-kill attacks and attack immunity.

00:37.440 --> 00:42.740
And it mind controls anyone who gets close.

00:42.820 --> 00:44.700
How will you slay it?

00:44.780 --> 00:45.620
Huh?

00:46.450 --> 00:47.290
Huh?

00:47.370 --> 00:48.580
Huh?

00:50.790 --> 00:51.620
Huh?

00:58.260 --> 00:59.220
Huh?

01:01.890 --> 01:02.720
Huh?

01:02.800 --> 01:05.010
You didn't think it through!?

01:05.100 --> 01:08.980
How do you slay the Blaze Dragon when it's imbued with "Divine Might"!?

01:11.310 --> 01:15.150
It'll be fine actually. Mabel's here, and she's got the God-Freezing Sword.

01:15.230 --> 01:16.690
The God-Freezing Sword!?

01:16.770 --> 01:20.150
The legendary weapon that overwhelmed the Blaze Dragon and—

01:24.660 --> 01:25.490
What the heck!?

01:25.580 --> 01:27.040
H-Hey, pull yourself together.

01:28.000 --> 01:30.620
You're from the legendary Ice Clan, right!?

01:30.710 --> 01:32.920
Now, hold on, you two!

01:33.000 --> 01:37.210
Screw you idiots. It's scary, okay?

01:37.300 --> 01:40.510
Stupid spiky hair. Stupid part over shaved sides.

01:40.590 --> 01:42.510
I'm a former regular knight, you know.

01:42.590 --> 01:44.970
C-Could you please speak up!?

01:45.050 --> 01:47.640
The God-Freezing Sword's a bust, Kuroki!

01:47.720 --> 01:48.810
What? Really?

01:48.890 --> 01:52.850
It is not a bust, you spiky-haired moron!

01:52.940 --> 01:56.060
Could you enunciate more clearly? Pretty please?

01:56.150 --> 01:58.020
This is bad, man. What are we gonna do!?

01:58.110 --> 02:00.820
Shit! That monster's gonna eat us for—

02:00.900 --> 02:01.950
- We can win.
- Huh!?

02:05.490 --> 02:07.990
- For real!?
- But how?

02:08.080 --> 02:09.120
Easy.

02:09.200 --> 02:13.080
Outpace its healing. Overpower it and kill it faster than it can repair itself.

02:13.160 --> 02:14.040
Huh!?

02:14.670 --> 02:15.500
See this sword?

02:16.330 --> 02:19.340
It's an ancient magical artifact that focuses power and releases it.

02:19.840 --> 02:25.180
Normally, I power it with the lightning magic accumulated in my armor.

02:25.260 --> 02:30.010
But if I were to channel orc-face's stupidly tremendous magic into this sword.

02:30.100 --> 02:31.470
And fire it out?

02:31.560 --> 02:34.190
Then the "Deified Blaze Dragon," I guess we'll call it?

02:36.150 --> 02:37.610
I can slay it.

02:38.560 --> 02:39.570
Relax.

02:39.650 --> 02:41.150
Ooh!

02:41.230 --> 02:44.360
Oh! But what about getting mind-controlled when you get close?

02:44.450 --> 02:45.280
Not a problem.

02:45.820 --> 02:49.240
The jewel on my forehead blocks all mental attacks.

02:49.330 --> 02:52.580
What about the blaze scales' attack immunity?

02:52.660 --> 02:55.710
You can damage it if you attack while it's burning you.

02:55.790 --> 02:58.670
Oh, huh! While it's bur...

03:00.300 --> 03:01.750
That would kill most people!

03:01.840 --> 03:03.970
Dragon breath is an insta-kill attack!

03:05.010 --> 03:06.550
We've verified it.

03:06.630 --> 03:08.680
Just use magic to guard against the breath.

03:08.760 --> 03:10.300
- We slew it.
- Yeah.

03:10.390 --> 03:11.970
I didn't need the God-Freezing Sword at all.

03:12.060 --> 03:16.810
Wait, Kuroki, you've both slain the Blaze Dragon!? Without the God-Freezing Sword!?

03:16.890 --> 03:19.560
Orc-face slew the real one himself.

03:19.650 --> 03:20.650
But either way...

03:20.730 --> 03:23.230
We never needed the God-Freezing Sword at all.

03:23.780 --> 03:24.610
Well, I'll be damned.

03:25.190 --> 03:26.900
So no one needs the God-Freezing Sword.

03:26.990 --> 03:28.610
Um...

03:28.700 --> 03:30.200
If I may...?

03:31.410 --> 03:37.580
I haven't yet told Edgar and Raiga that it was you who slew the goblin army.

03:37.670 --> 03:40.000
Let 'em keep the credit.

03:40.080 --> 03:41.670
It works better for me anyway.

03:41.750 --> 03:43.050
What...!? But...

03:43.130 --> 03:47.130
Anyway, about that memory I erased at the hot spring...

03:47.220 --> 03:49.090
Oh, the one where I was na...

03:49.180 --> 03:51.550
That's just silly—

03:54.140 --> 03:55.060
Icuras Cuora

03:56.350 --> 03:58.020
I'll remember it this time, so...

03:58.100 --> 03:59.980
Re-enact it for me.

04:03.270 --> 04:04.150
No.

04:04.820 --> 04:05.690
Huh?

04:06.690 --> 04:08.070
But maybe later, at an inn...

04:08.150 --> 04:09.820
Maaabeeel!

04:09.910 --> 04:10.740
Huh? What is it?

04:10.820 --> 04:15.830
These three are celebrities, you know! I haven't introduced you yet, have I!?

04:15.910 --> 04:17.500
Why are you yelling, Elf?

04:18.080 --> 04:19.710
Raiga! Edgar! Alicia!

04:19.790 --> 04:21.880
There you go! Their jobs are plain to see!

04:21.960 --> 04:25.210
Is this really the time for intros?

04:25.300 --> 04:27.970
You're right! This is a dire emergency!

04:28.050 --> 04:29.840
Whyever would we engage in chitchat?

04:29.930 --> 04:32.100
Look, there's a very good reason, really...

04:32.180 --> 04:34.010
I...

04:34.100 --> 04:38.310
Safe-guarded and wield the legendary God-Freezing Sword.

04:38.390 --> 04:40.770
My name is Mabel Rayveil.

04:41.400 --> 04:42.310
Everyone.

04:43.820 --> 04:46.230
It's nice to meet you, Mabel!

04:46.320 --> 04:47.940
- Nice to meet you.
- Nice to meetcha!

04:48.570 --> 04:49.490
Y...

04:50.280 --> 04:51.610
Yes!

04:51.700 --> 04:57.540
I used to be a regular knight, a job that freelance adventurers could never hope to land in a million years!

04:57.620 --> 05:00.000
It's a pleasure to meet my lessers!

05:03.170 --> 05:05.000
Y-Yes, a pleasure...

05:05.090 --> 05:06.050
Uh, sure...

05:06.750 --> 05:08.550
Does she feel any desire to get along with them?

05:08.630 --> 05:11.630
And isn't she jobless and homeless at this point?

05:12.800 --> 05:13.890
It's ready to act!?

05:17.810 --> 05:18.980
Are you doing this or what, Lady!?

05:19.060 --> 05:20.180
Not yet!!

05:20.270 --> 05:24.110
If we slay it while it's only part-revived, the "Divine Might Uncontrolled" might bring it back!!

05:24.190 --> 05:26.770
We need it to finish reviving first. So brace yourselves and wait it out!

05:26.860 --> 05:28.320
- Right!
- Got it!

05:28.900 --> 05:30.070
Okay, orc-face!

05:39.660 --> 05:42.580
I-I need to store up power!

05:42.670 --> 05:44.290
As much as I abhor it...

05:44.380 --> 05:47.040
I'll need you to fly me around! It's the only way!

05:47.130 --> 05:49.510
G-Go on! Get a move on!!

06:04.100 --> 06:06.900
Oh, for crying out loud.

06:06.980 --> 06:08.320
I know he has to carry me.

06:08.400 --> 06:10.490
But couldn't he do it in a kinder way?

06:10.570 --> 06:13.150
There. Now we're all set!

06:13.240 --> 06:14.950
So...

06:15.030 --> 06:18.160
That means nothing left for me to do, right?

06:19.450 --> 06:20.620
Huh!?

06:20.700 --> 06:22.960
Are you kidding!?

06:23.040 --> 06:24.580
How can she smile like that!?

06:24.670 --> 06:27.750
Great! Then I'll just get out of your way!

06:38.300 --> 06:39.140
It's watching her.

06:39.220 --> 06:42.020
It must really hate the Ice Clan!

06:42.100 --> 06:44.940
Ooh! Mabel can be the bait, then.

06:45.650 --> 06:47.650
That should make our work a lot easier.

06:48.650 --> 06:51.110
D-Don't worry, we'll support you!

06:56.580 --> 06:57.200
Here it comes!

06:57.280 --> 07:00.030
Urgh... Argh! Fine!

07:00.120 --> 07:02.660
I'll be your stupid bait!!

07:03.200 --> 07:04.410
With the God-Freezing Sword...

07:04.500 --> 07:06.250
No Blaze Dragon can—

07:08.210 --> 07:10.040
- A rock!?
- I've got this.

07:11.250 --> 07:13.380
Slash Engage!

07:14.880 --> 07:17.010
Tempest...

07:17.090 --> 07:19.390
Calibur!!

07:28.230 --> 07:29.360
I'll protect you!

07:29.440 --> 07:31.980
Hey! That was my move!!

07:33.940 --> 07:36.700
Okay. Looks like they're baiting it nicely.

07:36.780 --> 07:38.610
- Ah! It's coming back!
- I've got this!

07:38.700 --> 07:40.910
Strike Engage! Shura Ouga!

07:40.990 --> 07:42.290
Hey, that's mine!

07:44.830 --> 07:47.250
Worried you can't do it?

07:48.460 --> 07:52.670
You talked like it would be an easy win. But you were lying when you said "we could win," right?

07:53.750 --> 07:54.880
Why would you...?

07:56.010 --> 07:57.880
I had to say that.

07:59.220 --> 08:02.350
Otherwise, I'd be paralyzed with fear!

08:02.930 --> 08:04.600
I don't want those kids...

08:10.310 --> 08:12.940
To go through that miserable experience!

08:16.990 --> 08:18.240
Now I get it.

08:18.320 --> 08:20.910
That thought hadn't even crossed my mind.

08:22.620 --> 08:23.830
Aah! It's coming this way!

08:23.910 --> 08:25.080
Run for it!

08:25.160 --> 08:27.370
Impulse Calibur!!

08:28.370 --> 08:29.710
D-Did I get it!!?

08:30.710 --> 08:32.170
Ah, it ran away!

08:32.250 --> 08:33.840
Nice one, Edgar!

08:38.670 --> 08:41.340
Sorry, but I've honestly got no idea whether we can win.

08:41.430 --> 08:42.470
There's no precedent for this.

08:42.550 --> 08:45.220
I'm trying to think up strats myself, but so far...

08:45.310 --> 08:46.600
What!? Now, hold on here!

08:47.180 --> 08:50.310
What ever happened to "a crisis is an opportunity," huh!?

08:52.560 --> 08:54.730
A crisis is an opportunity.

08:55.360 --> 08:57.190
Isn't that the motto you live by!?

08:58.070 --> 08:59.400
You...

09:00.110 --> 09:02.740
You actually take the things I say seriously, huh.

09:13.670 --> 09:15.170
Ready to go, Sui?

09:15.250 --> 09:18.460
You'd better back me up, Yousuke!

09:18.550 --> 09:19.880
Uncle, stop the video!

09:20.590 --> 09:22.720
What's wrong, Takafumi?

09:23.260 --> 09:24.680
At long last.

09:26.890 --> 09:29.890
At long last, a proper otherworld fantasy battle!

09:32.560 --> 09:34.560
Want some coffee, guys?

09:34.650 --> 09:35.560
Sure!

09:37.270 --> 09:40.240
There isn't a man alive who hates otherworld fantasy battles.

09:40.320 --> 09:41.990
Oh, I should take a bathroom break too!

09:42.070 --> 09:46.030
And I am certainly no exception to that rule! I love them!

09:49.660 --> 09:52.000
It's been about ten months since Uncle woke up.

09:52.870 --> 09:55.710
It looks like I can finally see the otherworld battle I've longed for.

09:56.500 --> 09:58.960
You really love otherworld fantasy, don't you?

09:59.050 --> 10:00.800
You good? I'm playing it.

10:00.880 --> 10:01.880
Yeah!

10:06.430 --> 10:07.930
Ready to go, Sui?

10:08.010 --> 10:10.980
You'd better back me up, Yousuke!

10:19.320 --> 10:20.820
- Breath attack!
- I can take the first shot!

10:20.900 --> 10:21.740
It's gonna get hot!

10:24.610 --> 10:27.320
Baraibuuto Zarusherion

10:34.330 --> 10:37.250
Our enemy's major attacks are the breath of blaze, the tail...

10:37.330 --> 10:39.420
And the claw that comes randomly.

10:40.000 --> 10:41.510
Try to bait its claw attack!

10:41.590 --> 10:42.670
I know!

10:42.760 --> 10:44.010
Alright! I'm releasing you!

10:44.090 --> 10:47.010
Waldgrent Sladseld

11:02.990 --> 11:07.070
Suffocate by my icy blade and go to sleep!

11:12.830 --> 11:16.370
Rugaldos Golet Bustor

11:22.920 --> 11:24.340
Long Heavy Piercer.

11:56.750 --> 11:58.790
Super Long Star Breaker!

12:39.380 --> 12:43.130
It's just like an unbreakable spell

12:43.180 --> 12:47.340
All these feelings simply won't go away

12:47.390 --> 12:51.090
They're overflowing for someone

12:51.150 --> 12:57.930
And all I can think of is you

12:53.100 --> 12:56.310
Hey! If you were gonna use so much energy that you can't even fly, then you should've...

12:59.390 --> 13:01.410
Did that scare you?

13:04.030 --> 13:05.160
You...

13:10.290 --> 13:13.530
Unconsciously following in your footsteps

13:11.740 --> 13:14.030
We did it, Yousuke!

13:13.580 --> 13:17.750
I've been vague about these feelings

13:14.120 --> 13:15.870
What? I can't hear you!

13:15.950 --> 13:18.580
We did it, Yousuke!

13:17.800 --> 13:21.540
If I have to name them right now

13:18.660 --> 13:19.660
Huh?

13:21.590 --> 13:24.750
Only one word comes to mind

13:25.350 --> 13:28.840
My image of you is like dots in my mind

13:27.460 --> 13:28.840
We did it.

13:29.100 --> 13:32.800
I hurriedly connect them together

13:32.850 --> 13:36.100
Still searching for the answer between us

13:34.140 --> 13:35.730
Yousuke.

13:36.150 --> 13:42.520
Even when I'm at a loss, this warm feeling remains

13:43.160 --> 13:46.900
I don't simply want you to show a smile

13:46.950 --> 13:50.990
I want you to keep that smile fovever and ever

13:51.160 --> 13:54.870
These thoughts are repeating every second

13:54.920 --> 13:58.040
Is there something I could do

13:58.170 --> 14:01.870
It's just like an unbreakable spell

14:01.920 --> 14:05.880
All these feelings simply won't go away

14:06.140 --> 14:09.800
They're overflowing for someone

14:08.090 --> 14:09.420
There's a burnt smell.

14:09.850 --> 14:16.930
And all I can think of is you

14:09.920 --> 14:12.420
You smell like the incinerator from elementary school.

14:12.510 --> 14:15.890
Kyaa! Don't smell me!

14:15.970 --> 14:18.390
Wah!? Stop flailing around!

14:19.140 --> 14:21.430
What the heck are they doing?

14:21.520 --> 14:23.640
- Geh!?
- They fell!?

14:28.860 --> 14:30.320
Geez...

14:30.400 --> 14:33.360
It's always like this with you.

14:35.570 --> 14:40.450
The Blaze? It has completely fused with the "Divine Might Uncontrolled" huh?

14:40.540 --> 14:42.370
It's dangerous to harvest this.

14:42.450 --> 14:45.420
If it revives again and combines with some other great "Might", then...

14:45.500 --> 14:46.670
That's what I'm aiming for.

14:47.670 --> 14:49.420
Hey!

14:49.500 --> 14:50.880
Are you all right?

14:51.810 --> 14:53.840
You did it. The two of you.

14:53.920 --> 14:56.140
Well, it was fine I guess.

14:59.850 --> 15:03.350
Hey, hey, you know, I did a good job with the assist earlier, right!?

15:03.430 --> 15:04.350
Achievement! Achievement!

15:04.440 --> 15:06.650
You can praise me if you want!

15:06.730 --> 15:09.190
Ah... You're right.

15:10.150 --> 15:11.400
If I were by myself...

15:11.480 --> 15:13.900
I think I would've probably taken four months to slay it.

15:14.490 --> 15:17.160
And it might have resulted in collateral damage to the vicinity.

15:18.030 --> 15:19.370
It's thanks to everyone's help.

15:23.040 --> 15:24.040
I'm grateful.

15:27.580 --> 15:29.420
Especially Mabel.

15:29.500 --> 15:33.010
Even though you were so scared, you still fought. It was very helpful.

15:33.090 --> 15:34.970
As expected of the Ice Clan.

15:36.970 --> 15:40.010
Mabel, aren't you glad you got praised?

15:44.980 --> 15:49.150
What's that? "I want to be carried like Elf was"?

15:49.230 --> 15:51.190
W-W-W-Wait a minute. Mabel!?

15:51.270 --> 15:54.070
Oh. You want to fly in the sky too, Alicia?

15:54.150 --> 15:57.280
But I've already overused the spirits' powers.

15:57.360 --> 15:59.570
R-Right, right!

16:00.700 --> 16:01.620
Wha? No...

16:01.700 --> 16:03.160
- Wait...
- We'll skip the binding magic.

16:05.950 --> 16:07.830
I'm scared! I'm scared! I'm scaaared!

16:07.920 --> 16:10.500
Ku-Kuroki-kun!! Let me down already!

16:10.580 --> 16:13.300
Stop flailing around, Alicia. Heavy.

16:13.380 --> 16:16.220
Come on! Let me down already! Hey!

16:16.300 --> 16:18.260
Is it enough?

16:19.180 --> 16:20.720
It's not fair to just do Alicia!

16:20.800 --> 16:22.350
Kuroki! Me too! Me too!

16:22.430 --> 16:23.720
Then how about I do you both at once?

16:23.810 --> 16:26.180
Mabel?

16:23.810 --> 16:26.180
Sweet! Seriously?

16:26.980 --> 16:28.230
Mabel?

16:33.820 --> 16:36.690
Well, I thought it might be interesting?

16:33.820 --> 16:35.110
I feel sick...

16:35.190 --> 16:36.690
Kuroki, let us down!

16:37.740 --> 16:40.070
Aren't the two of you looking a bit scary?

16:40.410 --> 16:42.490
- Crap. It's coming up...
- Don't come near me!

16:42.570 --> 16:45.790
Oh, by the way, thank you for last night, Mabel.

16:46.870 --> 16:49.160
It was a captivating night.

16:49.670 --> 16:54.630
It's as if I could still hear your beautiful voice from last night even now.

16:55.550 --> 16:59.090
I fell asleep before you, but I hope you had enough sleep?

16:59.170 --> 17:02.550
Hey...! I asked you not to talk about that in front of other people...!

17:02.640 --> 17:04.760
Geez, Wolf. You're so...

17:04.850 --> 17:07.100
This is my thanks.

17:08.310 --> 17:09.980
I... already have one...

17:10.060 --> 17:11.980
Yeah... Go ahead and sell one of them.

17:12.060 --> 17:15.940
Well, it might appreciate in value.

17:16.020 --> 17:17.900
So maybe I'll hold onto it for a bit...?

17:19.360 --> 17:20.900
Hm... Hmph!

17:20.990 --> 17:26.990
Me and Yousu... orc-face are already beyond those stupid rings...

17:22.410 --> 17:25.410
Speaking of which, what was that "Wolf" thing earlier?

17:25.490 --> 17:27.620
Ah. That's my line. What's "Kuroki"?

17:27.700 --> 17:30.870
Ooh. Those are my names in this world.

17:30.960 --> 17:34.790
My real name from my original world is Shibazaki Yousuke.

17:34.880 --> 17:36.630
Shiba...?

17:36.710 --> 17:37.750
Yousu...?

17:43.720 --> 17:46.970
Wolfgunblood definitely sounds cooler!

17:47.060 --> 17:49.730
I feel the same with Kuroki Tenma.

17:53.690 --> 17:56.150
I know right!? They're super cool!

17:56.230 --> 17:59.570
They were the names of powerful foes I've fought against in the past in Japanbahamal.

17:59.650 --> 18:02.740
I'm impressed you can appreciate them. You two are quite something.

18:04.740 --> 18:07.950
Why did you tell them your name so easily...

18:08.040 --> 18:11.910
Why! Why! Why! Why!

18:14.790 --> 18:17.380
Watch it. If it breaks, things will get bad.

18:17.960 --> 18:19.960
What are you going to do with that?

18:21.210 --> 18:22.670
I have witnessed it.

18:23.630 --> 18:28.060
The moment the dragon was slayed, powerful energies collided.

18:28.140 --> 18:30.600
A warp in space-time appeared.

18:31.560 --> 18:32.560
Which means...

18:32.640 --> 18:37.610
If I make this thing grow even stronger, and hit it with an even more powerful attack.

18:37.690 --> 18:41.990
Then it might create an even bigger warp that maybe I can return to Japan through.

18:42.610 --> 18:43.900
W-What are you doing!?

18:45.160 --> 18:46.870
I'm destroying it.

18:57.080 --> 18:58.710
Tsundere-san...!!

18:58.790 --> 19:01.460
If you don't want him to leave, you should just say it...!

19:02.260 --> 19:03.970
Well, that's how it went.

19:04.050 --> 19:08.430
I was finally able to get a hold of something resembling a clue on how to get back to Japan.

19:09.140 --> 19:12.560
So, did you make the Blaze Dragon even stronger, and when you slayed it...

19:12.640 --> 19:15.810
You went through the space-time warp to get back here!? Was that what happened?

19:16.850 --> 19:18.230
- Ah. That's—
- Hold up!

19:18.940 --> 19:22.360
One step at a time, Fujimiya. Blowing through things like this isn't good.

19:22.440 --> 19:24.990
I mean, it's going to take another fourteen years from this point, right!?

19:25.070 --> 19:26.030
It's too long!

19:26.110 --> 19:27.950
That won't be a problem.

19:28.030 --> 19:30.330
I'm pretty much a solo-player.

19:30.410 --> 19:33.160
So there won't be many more events like this.

19:35.160 --> 19:37.000
Really now?

19:37.080 --> 19:41.590
Well, instances where Uncle's perception and reality are incongruent are pretty frequent.

19:48.720 --> 19:51.050
I'm feeling hungry.

19:51.140 --> 19:54.060
Then why don't we go out for some ramen again?

19:54.140 --> 19:54.980
My treat.

19:55.060 --> 19:56.810
- Your treat?
- Are you sure, Uncle!?

19:56.890 --> 19:59.400
- Absolutely!
- Heck yeah!

20:03.650 --> 20:05.490
It's a bit chilly today.

20:05.570 --> 20:08.910
Soon we won't need help from the Ice Spirit anymore.

20:08.990 --> 20:12.080
Offering a fish head is hard work.

20:21.960 --> 20:24.170
If aliens were to invade Earth today...

20:24.250 --> 20:26.470
What would you do, Fujimiya-san?

20:26.550 --> 20:28.510
I'll get Uncle to use magic and kick their butts!

20:32.140 --> 20:34.600
A lot has happened this year.

20:49.320 --> 20:51.160
We started posting videos online...

20:56.040 --> 20:58.790
I reconnected with an old friend...

21:04.500 --> 21:07.710
And I've already gotten used to living with Uncle.

21:09.220 --> 21:13.470
The anxiety I felt we first met feels so unreal now.

21:21.440 --> 21:25.610
Well, Uncle, your life in the otherworld seems to go pretty well, for what it's worth.

21:25.690 --> 21:27.280
Oh? Is that so?

21:29.320 --> 21:31.030
You had friends.

21:31.110 --> 21:33.200
And you got along well with Elf-san.

21:35.620 --> 21:37.660
The Memory Spirit is acting on its own...

21:42.500 --> 21:43.580
Uncle!

21:44.380 --> 21:46.630
Uncle, something awful happened again!

21:48.760 --> 21:50.010
Ooh.

21:50.760 --> 21:52.090
At that time...

21:53.010 --> 21:55.800
All of my valuables were confiscated and I was thrown in jail.

21:55.890 --> 21:58.010
Why!?

22:11.750 --> 22:14.260
​Refrain from recovering those lost memories

22:14.260 --> 22:20.550
Rewrite in words that only gives a glimpse of the story

22:20.550 --> 22:22.770
Don't end this Won't change it

22:20.550 --> 22:22.770
Don't end this Won't change it​

22:22.810 --> 22:25.430
It'll stay the same no matter what happens

22:25.480 --> 22:28.810
I'll never lose sight of my goal​

22:28.940 --> 22:32.520
Who was the one to decide

22:32.570 --> 22:36.950
That way of life is unlike you

22:36.990 --> 22:40.200
Having the strength to pursue your goal

22:40.240 --> 22:42.450
That's what it means to be strong​

22:42.450 --> 22:46.830
It's something you already knew

22:46.910 --> 22:49.000
I believe in what I've done

22:49.000 --> 22:51.130
No reason to go back again

22:51.130 --> 22:55.840
Those days gone by full of precious moments

22:55.840 --> 22:57.720
Easy losing memories

22:57.720 --> 22:59.840
I'm struggling now to overcome

22:59.840 --> 23:04.520
I'm never going to give up​ until the very end​

23:04.520 --> 23:06.390
Get down let's get down

23:06.390 --> 23:13.270
The light still shines in my heart

23:13.270 --> 23:15.940
Trust yourself

23:15.940 --> 23:18.030
Don't deny

23:18.030 --> 23:20.240
Save yourself

23:20.280 --> 23:22.700
Don't forget

23:51.920 --> 23:53.800
Life with Uncle...

23:55.050 --> 23:57.380
Has only just begun!
